    "text": "Chiesa Nuova, formally Santa Maria in Vallicella, is a Roman Catholic church in Rome that serves as the principal church of the Oratorians. Its architecture and interior art exemplify Counter‑Reformation ideals and house masterpieces by leading Baroque artists.",
    "sourceIds": ["wikipedia"]
